    <main class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">About ToolShare</h1>
                <p class="lead text-muted">A peer-to-peer tool library connecting neighbors who lend and borrow tools safely.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center"><div class="card-body p-4"><i class="fas fa-users fa-3x text-primary mb-3"></i><h3 class="h5">Community First</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">Borrow from people in your neighborhood instead of buying tools you rarely use.</p></div></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center"><div class="card-body p-4"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt fa-3x text-primary mb-3"></i><h3 class="h5">Safe by Design</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">Deposits, QR handovers, damage reports, and librarian supervision keep every rental protected.</p></div></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center"><div class="card-body p-4"><i class="fas fa-coins fa-3x text-primary mb-3"></i><h3 class="h5">Earn Money</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">Owners earn income from tools sitting idle at home while borrowers save on purchases.</p></div></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="card shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">How the Library Works</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted">ToolShare is organized around three roles: <strong>members</strong> who lend and borrow tools, <strong>librarians</strong> who supervise bookings, disputes, and payments, and <strong>maintenance technicians</strong> who keep tools safe and in good condition. Every rental goes through deposit escrow, QR-verified handover, and post-return inspection — so trust is built into the platform, not left to chance.</p>
                    <a href="/Home/howitworks" class="btn btn-primary">See How It Works</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
